          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 17418
        },
        {
          "statement": "We believe that adequate sources of supply exist, but they may cost more or require us to incur higher transportation costs.",
          "pattern": "we\\s+(?:expect|anticipate|believe|plan|intend|forecast|project)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 23353
        },
        {
          "statement": "Human CapitalWe believe that our team members are the foundation of our business and that their hard work, passion, commitment, and experience drive our success.",
          "pattern": "we\\s+(?:expect|anticipate|believe|plan|intend|forecast|project)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 36247
        },
        {
          "statement": "We believe internal promotions, coupled with the hiring of individuals with previous retail experience, provide the management structure necessary to support our long-term strategic growth initiatives.",
          "pattern": "we\\s+(?:expect|anticipate|believe|plan|intend|forecast|project)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 38489
        },
        {
          "statement": "We plan to open approximately 90 new Tractor Supply and approximately 10 new Petsense by Tractor Supply stores in fiscal 2025, a selling square footage increase of approximately 4%.",
          "pattern": "we\\s+(?:expect|anticipate|believe|plan|intend|forecast|project)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 43152
        },
        {
          "statement": "Given the size of the communities that we target, we believe there is ample opportunity for new store growth in many existing and new markets.",
          "pattern": "we\\s+(?:expect|anticipate|believe|plan|intend|forecast|project)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 43874
        },
        {
          "statement": "We believe we have developed a proven method for selecting store sites and have significant additional opportunities for new Tractor Supply stores.",
          "pattern": "we\\s+(?:expect|anticipate|believe|plan|intend|forecast|project)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 43967
        },
        {
          "statement": "However, we believe we successfully differentiate ourselves from many of these retailers by focusing on our specialized market niche for customers living the rural lifestyle.",
          "pattern": "we\\s+(?:expect|anticipate|believe|plan|intend|forecast|project)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 45421
        },
        {
          "statement": "Our Navarre, Ohio distribution center is the first Tractor Supply facility LEED Gold certified, and we expect our Maumelle, Arkansas distribution center to receive LEED Gold certification in 2025.",
          "pattern": "we\\s+(?:expect|anticipate|believe|plan|intend|forecast|project)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 48781
        },
        {
          "statement": "Past comparable store sales are not an indication of future results, and there can be no assurance that our comparable store sales will not decrease in the future.",
          "pattern": "future\\s+(?:growth|performance|results|outlook)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 64244
        },
        {
          "statement": "We believe our past performance has been based upon, and future success will depend in part upon, the ability to develop and execute merchandising initiatives with effective marketing programs.",
          "pattern": "we\\s+(?:expect|anticipate|believe|plan|intend|forecast|project)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 64431
        },
        {
          "statement": "To the extent that we are unable to open new stores in the manner we anticipate (due to, among other reasons, site approval or unforeseen delays in construction), our sales growth may be impeded.",
